2	//
3	// Deliberately dependency-free: a local pack's check modules must load even when
4	// the gitignored canon mount is absent (the project's own vitest run is exactly
5	// that situation), so nothing here imports `engine/checks/helpers/*`. The two
6	// things every rule needs are a finding constructor and a comment stripper.
